                },
                "text": "{icon_act|[act]} {icon_stand|[engage]} a Bunny & Baron, Specter Duo on your field: Maneuver this card. (For the rest of this turn, it becomes a follower with {icon_power|[attack]}3/{icon_hp|[defense]}3.)\n{icon_act|[act]} {icon_cost01|[cost01]}, {icon_stand|[engage]} 2 followers on your field: Maneuver this card.\nStorm.\nStrike - If there's another Wasteland follower on your field, draw a card.",
